  "WorldMap values is a float array the app sets (exported), valueCountries the countries in its order: map_info {region: \"Europe\"} lists the 48 countries alphabetically (Russia in, Turkey out); 0 leaves the land, 1 fills in valueColor, a fraction blends; a microstate with no outline at the detail is a dot",
